nuing Operations before Income Taxes, Noncontrolling Interest","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ni":{"c":"us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss","l":"Income loss, book value","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"pl":{"c":"us-gaap:ProfitLoss","l":"Net Income (Loss), Including Portion Attributable to Noncontrolling Interest","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"ocf":{"c":"us-gaap:NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities","l":"Cash Provided by (Used in) Operating Activity, Including Discontinued Operation","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"da":{"c":"us-gaap:DepreciationAndAmortization","l":"Depreciation, Depletion and Amortization, Nonproduction","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"dep":{"c":"us-gaap:Depreciation","l":"Depreciation","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"rev_contract":{"c":"us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax","l":"Revenue from Contract with Customer, Excluding Assessed Tax","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"},"capex":{"c":"us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquirePropertyPlantAndEquipment","l":"Fixed asset, net","ytd":false,"how":"xbrl"}},"lines_struct":null,"lines":null,"lines_py":null,"notes":{}}},"intro":{"text":"Eva Live Inc. (the \u201cCompany\u201d) was incorporated under the laws of the State of Nevada on August 27, 2002, as International Pit Boss Gaming, Inc. On October 1, 2002, the Company merged with Pro Roads Systems, Inc., a Florida corporation and a public shell company listed on the Pink Sheets. Pro Roads Systems, Inc. had no operations before the merger. The purpose of the merger was to change the Company\u2019s domicile from Florida to Nevada. From its inception to 2006, the Company designed and developed software for the gaming industry. The Company changed its name on February 14, 2006, to Logo Industries Corporation and, on November 18, 2008, to Malwin Ventures Inc. On February 11, 2014, the Company announced negotiations with Impact Future Media LLC, and its President/Founder, Francois Garcia, acquired 100 % of Impact Future Media LLC and its media and entertainment assets.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1983736/000149315225021484/form10-q.htm","filed":"2025-11-10","source":"10-Q"},"da_v":2}